                        <locus target="#17v">-17v</locus>وَلَكُمْ مَا كَسَبْتُمْ وَلَا تُسْئَلُوْنَ عَمَا كَنُوْا يَعْمِلُوْنَ<note>Some ḥarakāt under šadda-s</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>1:1-2:141. Eleven lines a page. Titles of suras rubricated. Ihmāl signs (rā’-s). Few words completed on the following line. And also few words left uncompleted, and rewritten in full on the following line. Corrections and clarifications (tawḍīḥ) in the margins.</note>
